Short:        Fast 3D mapper in 68k asm, used in Enforce
Author:       Filip Doksansky
Uploader:     troda cbnet cz
Type:         dev/asm
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

DESCRIPTION
The Enfroce engine has been developed by Filip Doksansky. The used 68k
3D mapping code are still fastest what i seen in game, so i ask him if
is possible, when the Enforce is canceled, relase at least the very fast
beta (but it have limitations and bugses, ofcourse ;) what i still
holding and the sources, at least the critical ones.
Hope anyone find the asm sources interesting and try learn from it.
Feedback to author is not possible.

